.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-admin-url 1  "oct-admin-url " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-admin\-url \- Set certificate URL
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct admin url\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIURL\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Set certificate URL
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIURL\fR>
URL that provides the certificate for the key material on this card
